<title>UK: LME appoints Phelps Dodge VP as invited director.</title>
<headline>LME appoints Phelps Dodge VP as invited director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) said on Thursday that it had appointed Art Miele as one of its invited directors on the Board.</p>
<p>Miele is Vice-President Marketing of Phelps Dodge Corporation and President of Phelps Dodge Sales Company. He was appointed at the recent LME Board meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;Art brings with him a wealth of experience of the copper industry and will be well placed to make a major contribution to the future of the Exchange,&quot; the LME said.</p>
<p>Last month, the LME amended its constitution and increased the numbers of invited directors to six from four.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
